# Reel media stays on disk, never in git history.
# As of 2026-07-28 the working tree carries ~6.9GB across ~4,400 source photos,
# Drive pulls, frame sequences and renders. Documents and build scripts are tracked,
# the pixels are not.

# Stills, renders, audio, exports
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.gif
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mp3
*.wav
*.pdf
*.xlsx

# Audio stems and fonts. Added 2026-07-28 after a `git add -A` swept in an 8MB
# music_draft.m4a plus three duplicated copies of the same .ttf files.
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2

# Frame sequences and render scratch
**/frames/
**/*_frames/

# Python / OS
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
